    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG John O’Brien are proud to introduce 51 Knocktornagh, Castleblayney, Co Monaghan to the market — a beautifully presented three-bedroom semi-detached residence located within a highly regarded and well-established residential development.\r\n\r\nSet on a superb site with both front and rear gardens, the property enjoys excellent privacy together with generous private parking to the front. Finished to an exceptional standard throughout, this home offers a bright, warm, and welcoming interior that is sure to impress from the moment you step inside.\r\n\r\nConveniently situated just minutes from the N2 bypass and within walking distance of Castleblayney town centre, the property benefits from immediate access to a host of local amenities including schools, shops, restaurants, churches, and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is both spacious and thoughtfully designed to suit modern family living. The ground floor comprises a comfortable sitting room, a contemporary open-plan kitchen/dining area ideal for entertaining and a guest WC.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property features three generously sized bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, along with a stylish family bathroom. Each room has been carefully designed with comfort and practicality in mind.\r\n\r\nOutside, the home is approached by a concrete driveway, while the rear/side boasts a large fully enclosed garden with garden shed — perfect for relaxing, entertaining, or enjoying family activities in complete privacy.\r\n\r\nCombining comfort, style, and convenience, this impressive home presents a wonderful opportunity for first-time buyers, families, or investors seeking a quality property in a prime location.\r\n\r\n*Viewing highly recommended**"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: 5.58m x 1.97m\r\nLiving Room: 5.21m x 3.46m with open fire \r\n\r\nKitchen: 5.54m x 3.23m\r\nGuest WC: 1.41m x 0.80m\r\n\r\nLanding: - 2.87m x 2.48m\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 4.33m x 3.38m with ensuite 2.34m x 1.19m\r\nBedroom 2: 3.40m x 2.39m\r\nBedroom 3: 2.49m x 2.25m \r\n\r\nBathroom: 3.30m x 2.06m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Total floor area of approx: sqm\r\nWalking distance to Castleblayney town centre & all local amenities\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout\r\nOFCH\r\nTriple glazed windows & doors\r\nSought after location \r\nMains services\r\nCarpet, wooden & tiled flooring throughout"
      },
